  "description": "Challenge the Sablo, push its limits and feel it come alive. When riding this full suspension mountain bike, you're sure to get maximum pleasure out of any trail.\n\nIts high-quality fork and custom rear shock deliver optimal comfort for keeping you fresh until the finish line of that exceptionally long marathon race. They also ensure for a stable feeling on those treacherous descents - along with the help of its perfectly balanced geometry, of course.\n\nWith the Sablo, go ahead and take obstacles at speed, thanks to its light weight and high reactivity. You'll find yourself manoeuvring nimbly through rock gardens and accelerating aggressively like a pro!\n\nDid we also mention that it's the perfect weapon for riding everyone off your wheel?",
